  "limits": [
    "Five bays and two glazing positions supported by 001/003/116; facade plane follows 102.",
    "Starts derive from conditional P06 116 camera rays. Width, recess depth, sill and reveals are visual candidates, not surveyed.",
    "Shadow boundaries must not be interpreted as blind-niche edges. Hidden construction and basement facade windows remain open.",
    "R27 revised topology: full inter-bay sloping piers, separate raised niche soffits, recessed continuous lower back plane. 003/004/005 and 061/062 reviewed together.",
    "Window head and sill reset to full-height ground-gallery candidate; all dimensions remain unmeasured.",
    "061/062 exact room/pose unresolved; not a metric correspondence."
  ],
